        "notes": "## Changelog\n\n### Other\n- chore: 更新 README / update READMEs (#52) by @arnoldhao\n  - add homebrew\n- feat: improve ytdlp (#57) by @arnoldhao\n  - 快速下载 playlist 仅下载第一个视频；自定义解析 playlist 转为批量下载\n  - 自定义下载在纯视频流合并场景支持选择音轨，快速下载新增最高码率选项\n  - handle playlist downloads\n  - allow custom downloads to choose audio tracks for video-only formats, and add a max-bitrate quick download mode\n  - resolved #54 related #53\n- feat: 完善应用会话验证 / improve app session verification (#58) by @arnoldhao\n  - 为 TikTok、Instagram、X、Facebook、Vimeo、Twitch、Niconico 补齐账号信息获取与验证\n  - Add account fetching and verification for TikTok, Instagram, X, Facebook, Vimeo, Twitch, and Niconico\n  - Resolve #53",
